{"id": "f9171ddb-60a9-4bf7-a040-5efd4e43270a", "slug": "sylvan-testimonials-array", "title": "Sylvan Testimonials Array", "description": "Sylvan Testimonials UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Sylvan Testimonials Array\"\ndescription: \"Sylvan Testimonials UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#1B2B22\"\n  accent: \"#34D399\"\n  background: \"#EEF1EA\"\n  surface: \"#1B2B22\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#1B2B22\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"23px\"\n  control: \"23px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Sylvan Testimonials Array\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 30; favorites: 8; remixes: 5.\nTags: testimonial, section, social-proof, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nSylvan Testimonials UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\n@field_ops @dr_aris A place to display your field milestones. \"Sylvan completely revolutionized our data collection in deep forest sectors.\" Elara Vance \"Integrating their packets into our mesh networks was entirely sea…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: A place to display your field milestones.; Elara Vance; Dr. Aris; Jonah R. Fielding; Team Alpha; M. Chen.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #1B2B22, accent #34D399, background #EEF1EA, surface #1B2B22, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Sylvan Testimonials Array</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#eef1ea] font-sans text-base antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#10b981] selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Decorative Container Lines & Squares (Skill Directive) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-evenly opacity-10\">\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-[#1b2b22] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-12 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-[#1b2b22] bg-[#eef1ea]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-12 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-[#1b2b22] bg-[#eef1ea]\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-[#1b2b22] relative hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-[#1b2b22] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-[#1b2b22] bg-[#eef1ea]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-[#1b2b22] bg-[#eef1ea]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Container -->\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-12 relative z-10 py-20 px-4 md:px-8 min-h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- Header Section -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center mt-8 relative\">\n\n            <!-- Floating Tags mimicking reference image -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-10 -left-12 lg:-left-24 hidden md:flex bg-[#2563eb] text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium -rotate-12 shadow-lg items-center gap-1.5 z-40\">\n                @field_ops\n                <div class=\"w-0 h-0 border-l-[6px] border-l-transparent border-t-[8px] border-t-[#2563eb] border-r-[6px] border-r-transparent absolute -bottom-1.5 left-6 transform rotate-[15deg]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-4 -right-8 lg:-right-20 hidden md:flex bg-[#10b981] text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium rotate-[8deg] shadow-lg items-center gap-1.5 z-40\">\n                @dr_aris\n                <div class=\"w-0 h-0 border-l-[6px] border-l-transparent border-t-[8px] border-t-[#10b981] border-r-[6px] border-r-transparent absolute -bottom-1.5 right-6 transform -rotate-[15deg]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[#111814] leading-tight max-w-2xl\">\n                A place to display your field milestones.\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Overlapping Card Fan Array (Adapting Source Testimonials) -->\n        <div class=\"flex justify-center items-center w-full -space-x-16 sm:-space-x-24 md:-space-x-32 lg:-space-x-40 py-12 h-[380px] md:h-[450px]\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Far Left -->\n            <div class=\"w-56 md:w-64 h-[260px] md:h-[300px] rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-white/40 to-[#c8d4c0] shadow-xl z-10 transform -rotate-[12deg] translate-y-12 hidden lg:block transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 hover:-translate-y-4 hover:z-50\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#f0f4e8] rounded-[23px] w-full h-full p-5 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden relative\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-linear\" width=\"64\" class=\"absolute -top-4 -right-4 text-[#c8d4c0] opacity-30\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <p class=\"text-[#4a6b57] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed\">\"Sylvan completely revolutionized our data collection in deep forest sectors.\"</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-4\">\n                        <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=32\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-[#2f4035] font-semibold text-xs\">Elara Vance</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Inner Left -->\n            <div class=\"w-56 md:w-64 h-[280px] md:h-[320px] rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#34d399]/30 to-transparent shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] z-20 transform -rotate-[6deg] translate-y-6 hidden sm:block transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 hover:-translate-y-4 hover:z-50 bg-[#1b2b22]\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#1b2b22] rounded-[23px] w-full h-full p-5 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden relative group\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1b2b22] to-transparent z-10\"></div>\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542601906990-b4d3fb778b09?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40 mix-blend-overlay group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[#eef1ea] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed relative z-20 mt-auto mb-4\">\"Integrating their packets into our mesh networks was entirely seamless.\"</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 relative z-20\">\n                        <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=11\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-[#34d399]\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-xs\">Dr. Aris</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Center Featured (Contains Canvas) -->\n            <div class=\"w-64 md:w-72 lg:w-80 h-[320px] md:h-[380px] rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#10b981]/50 via-[#10b981]/10 to-transparent shadow-[0_20px_40px_-10px_rgba(11,18,14,0.6)] z-30 transform rotate-0 scale-105 md:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-115 bg-[#0b120e] group relative\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0b120e] rounded-[23px] w-full h-full p-6 md:p-8 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col\">\n                    <canvas id=\"spatial-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-60 mix-blend-screen transition-opacity duration-700 group-hover:opacity-100 z-0\"></canvas>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0b120e] via-[#0b120e]/60 to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col h-full justify-between\">\n                        <div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:quote-left-linear\" width=\"28\" class=\"text-[#34d399] mb-4 opacity-80\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <p class=\"text-[#eef1ea] text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed font-medium italic\">\n                                \"A masterclass in decentralized stability. The way Sylvan processes bio-metric scanning while maintaining network integrity is miraculous.\"\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mt-6\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#34d399] to-transparent flex-shrink-0\">\n                                <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=47\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\">Jonah R. Fielding</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-[#34d399] font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase mt-0.5\">Chief Operations</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 4: Inner Right -->\n            <div class=\"w-56 md:w-64 h-[280px] md:h-[320px] rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-bl from-white via-white/60 to-[#eef1ea] shadow-lg z-20 transform rotate-[6deg] translate-y-6 hidden sm:block transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 hover:-translate-y-4 hover:z-50\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-[23px] w-full h-full p-5 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden relative\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-24 bg-[#e6ebd6] rounded-xl mb-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-linear\" width=\"80\" class=\"absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 text-[#c8d4c0] opacity-50\" style=\"stroke-width: 1;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-[#4a6b57] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed\">\"Localized network stability guarantees our telemetry never drops.\"</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-auto\">\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#1b2b22] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-semibold\">T</div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-[#2f4035] font-semibold text-xs\">Team Alpha</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 5: Far Right -->\n            <div class=\"w-56 md:w-64 h-[260px] md:h-[300px] rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-bl from-[#10b981]/20 to-transparent shadow-xl z-10 transform rotate-[12deg] translate-y-12 hidden lg:block transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 hover:-translate-y-4 hover:z-50 bg-[#e6ebd6]\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#e6ebd6] rounded-[23px] w-full h-full p-5 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden relative\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[#2f4035] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed mt-4\">\"Canopy Sense provides a level of clarity we didn't think was possible in disconnected wild spaces.\"</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-auto border-t border-[#c8d4c0] pt-4\">\n                        <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=68\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-[#4a6b57] font-semibold text-xs\">M. Chen</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Action Area -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-6 z-20 mt-4 md:mt-8 px-4\">\n            <p class=\"text-[#4a6b57] text-sm md:text-base max-w-lg text-center font-medium leading-relaxed\">\n                Pioneers can display their milestones, and networks can discover and utilize biometrics that resonate with global conservation goals.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-3 md:gap-4 mt-2\">\n                <button class=\"bg-[#1b2b22] hover:bg-black text-[#eef1ea] font-medium text-sm py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 shadow-md transform active:scale-[0.98]\">\n                    Join for $9.99/m\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"bg-transparent hover:bg-black/5 text-[#1b2b22] font-medium text-sm py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\">\n                    Read more\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Canvas Animation Script from Source -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('spatial-canvas');\n            if (!canvas) return;\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let width, height;\n            let nodes = [];\n\n            function resize() {\n                width = canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth;\n                height = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight;\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            class Node {\n                constructor() {\n                    this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                    this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                    this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6;\n                    this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6;\n                }\n                update() {\n                    this.x += this.vx;\n                    this.y += this.vy;\n                    if (this.x < 0 || this.x > width) this.vx *= -1;\n                    if (this.y < 0 || this.y > height) this.vy *= -1;\n                }\n                draw() {\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.5)';\n                    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                    ctx.strokeRect(this.x - 1, this.y - 1, 2, 2);\n                }\n            }\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < 40; i++) nodes.push(new Node());\n\n            let angle = 0;\n\n            function animate() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n                angle += 0.003;\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {\n                    nodes[i].update();\n                    nodes[i].draw();\n\n                    for (let j = i + 1; j < nodes.length; j++) {\n                        const dx = nodes[i].x - nodes[j].x;\n                        const dy = nodes[i].y - nodes[j].y;\n                        const distance = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                        if (distance < 70) {\n                            ctx.beginPath();\n                            ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(16, 185, 129, ${0.2 - distance/350})`;\n                            ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                            ctx.moveTo(nodes[i].x, nodes[i].y);\n                            ctx.lineTo(nodes[j].x, nodes[j].y);\n                            ctx.stroke();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                const cx = width / 2;\n                const cy = height / 3;\n                const size = 30;\n\n                const points = [\n                    {x: 0, y: -size, z: 0},\n                    {x: size, y: 0, z: size},\n                    {x: 0, y: 0, z: -size},\n                    {x: -size, y: 0, z: size},\n                    {x: 0, y: size, z: 0}\n                ];\n\n                const projected = points.map(p => {\n                    const cosA = Math.cos(angle);\n                    const sinA = Math.sin(angle);\n                    const rx = p.x * cosA - p.z * sinA;\n                    const rz = p.x * sinA + p.z * cosA;\n                    const scale = 200 / (200 + rz);\n                    return { x: cx + rx * scale, y: cy + p.y * scale };\n                });\n\n                ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15)';\n                ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(projected[0].x, projected[0].y); ctx.lineTo(projected[1].x, projected[1].y);\n                ctx.lineTo(projected[4].x, projected[4].y); ctx.lineTo(projected[3].x, projected[3].y);\n                ctx.closePath(); ctx.stroke();\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(projected[0].x, projected[0].y); ctx.lineTo(projected[2].x, projected[2].y);\n                ctx.lineTo(projected[4].x, projected[4].y); ctx.stroke();\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(projected[1].x, projected[1].y); ctx.lineTo(projected[2].x, projected[2].y);\n                ctx.lineTo(projected[3].x, projected[3].y); ctx.stroke();\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "sylvan-testimonials-array.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/sylvan-testimonials-array.jpg", "source_name": "sylvan-testimonials-array-DESIGN.md", "views": 389, "forks": 25, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:22:11.168467+00:00"}